					class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-xl text-gray-600"
				>
					Ofrecemos servicios jurídicos integrales con un enfoque personalizado para cada cliente
				</p>
			</div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl">
					<div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-100">
						<i class="ri-home-line text-2xl text-blue-600"></i>
					</div><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Civil</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-gray-600"
					>
						Contratos, compraventas, alquileres, desahucios y responsabilidad civil
					</p><ul class="space-y-2">
						<li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Contratos y compraventas
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Desahucios
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Accidentes y responsabilidad civil
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl">
					<div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-purple-100">
						<i class="ri-heart-line text-2xl text-purple-600"></i>
					</div><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho de Familia</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-gray-600"
					>
						Divorcios, separaciones, herencias y sucesiones
					</p><ul class="space-y-2">
						<li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Divorcios y separaciones
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Herencias y sucesiones
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Incumplimientos de sentencia
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl">
					<div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-orange-100">
						<i class="ri-building-line text-2xl text-orange-600"></i>
					</div><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Mercantil</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-gray-600"
					>
						Asesoramiento integral a empresas y contratación mercantil
					</p><ul class="space-y-2">
						<li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Contratación mercantil
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Reestructuraciones empresariales
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Asesoramiento integral
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl">
					<div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-100">
						<i class="ri-shield-line text-2xl text-red-600"></i>
					</div><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Penal</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-gray-600"
					>
						Defensa y acusación particular en procesos penales
					</p><ul class="space-y-2">
						<li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Denuncias y delitos leves
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Defensa particular
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Acusación particular
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div><div class="rounded-xl bg-white p-8 shadow-lg transition-shadow hover:shadow-xl">
					<div class="mb-6 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-green-100">
						<i class="ri-briefcase-line text-2xl text-green-600"></i>
					</div><h3 class="mb-4 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Derecho Laboral</h3><p
						class="mb-6 text-gray-600"
					>
						Despidos, indemnizaciones y conflictos laborales
					</p><ul class="space-y-2">
						<li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Despidos e indemnizaciones
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Reclamaciones salariales
						</li><li class="flex items-center text-sm text-gray-700">
							<div class="mr-2 flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center">
								<i class="ri-check-line text-green-600"></i>
							</div>Conflictos laborales
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-12 text-center">
				<a
					class="btn btn-primary btn-wide btn-lg font-semibold transition-colors"
					href="/servicios"
					data-discover="true">Ver todos los Servicios</a
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<GoogleReviews />
